   1:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** /*------------------------------------------------------------------------/
   2:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** /  Foolproof MMCv3/SDv1/SDv2 (in SPI mode) control module
   3:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** /-------------------------------------------------------------------------/
   4:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** /
   5:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** /  Copyright (C) 2013, ChaN, all right reserved.
