  10:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** / * Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice.
  11:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** /
  12:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** /-------------------------------------------------------------------------/
  13:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c ****   Features and Limitations:
  14:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** 
  15:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c ****   * Easy to Port Bit-banging SPI
  16:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c ****     It uses only four GPIO pins. No complex peripheral needs to be used.
  17:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** 
  18:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c ****   * No Media Change Detection
  19:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c ****     Application program needs to perform a f_mount() after media change.
  20:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** 
  21:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** /-------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
  22:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** 
  23:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** 
  24:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** #include "diskio.h"		/* Common include file for FatFs and disk I/O layer */
  25:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** 
  26:Libraries\FatFs_Library/sdcard.c **** 
